<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Hidden Key 방탈출 카페</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Pretendard', 'Noto Sans KR', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0b0b10;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(5, 5, 10, 0.9);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }

    .nav {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 18px 30px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #f6c453;
    }

    .menu {
      display: flex;
      gap: 28px;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #ddd;
    }

    .menu a:hover {
      color: #f6c453;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 160px 30px 100px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.7), rgba(0,0,0,0.92)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519074069444-1ba4fff66d16?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 1200px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero small {
      color: #f6c453;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 64px;
      line-height: 1.15;
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .hero p {
      margin-top: 24px;
      max-width: 620px;
      color: #ccc;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .highlight {
      color: #f6c453;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      margin-top: 36px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 26px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #f6c453;
      color: #121212;
      border: none;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      border: 1px solid #f6c453;
      color: #f6c453;
    }

    section {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 90px 30px;
    }

    .section-title {
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .section-title span {
      color: #f6c453;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 36px;
    }

    .about-box {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .info-card,
    .theme-card,
    .stats-card,
    .theme-stats,
    .notice-list {
      background: #15151f;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .info-card {
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }

    .info-card h3 {
      color: #f6c453;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .info-card p {
      color: #bbb;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .theme-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .theme-card {
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .theme-img {
      height: 180px;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    }

    .theme-content {
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .theme-content h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #f6c453;
    }

    .theme-content p {
      color: #bbb;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .easy {
      background-color: #233b2a;
      color: #8cff9d;
    }

    .normal {
      background-color: #3b3523;
      color: #ffd56a;
    }

    .hard {
      background-color: #4a1e1e;
      color: #ff8b8b;
    }

    .premium {
      background-color: #32204a;
      color: #cfa6ff;
    }

    .tag-wrap {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .tag {
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(246,196,83,0.12);
      color: #f6c453;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .stats-box {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .stats-card {
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stats-card h3 {
      color: #ddd;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .stats-card strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 42px;
      color: #f6c453;
    }

    .stats-card p {
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .theme-stats {
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .stat-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr 60px;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .stat-item span {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ddd;
    }

    .stat-item b {
      color: #f6c453;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .bar {
      height: 14px;
      background: #20202c;
      border-radius: 30px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: #f6c453;
      border-radius: 30px;
    }

    .rate68 { width: 68%; }
    .rate44 { width: 44%; }
    .rate73 { width: 73%; }
    .rate29 { width: 29%; }

    .reservation {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #11111a;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 34px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .reservation-layout {
      display: flex;
      gap: 70px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .left-area,
    .right-area {
      width: 50%;
    }

    .date-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .date-box {
      padding: 16px 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #20202c;
      color: #ddd;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .time-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .time-buttons button {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #20202c;
      color: #ddd;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .date-box:hover,
    .time-buttons button:hover {
      background: #f6c453;
      color: #121212;
    }

    .form-box label {
      display: block;
      margin: 16px 0 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #ddd;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .form-box label:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .form-box input,
    .form-box select,
    .form-box textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #20202c;
      color: #fff;
      outline: none;
    }

    .form-box textarea {
      height: 90px;
      resize: none;
    }

    .guide-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #15151f;
    }

    th,
    td {
      padding: 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      text-align: center;
    }

    th {
      background: rgba(246,196,83,0.12);
      color: #f6c453;
    }

    .notice-list {
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 28px;
    }

    .notice-list li {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #ccc;
    }

    .location-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #15151f, #221a2c);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 40px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 30px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .location-box h3 {
      color: #f6c453;
    }

    .map-dummy {
      min-height: 240px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.45), rgba(0,0,0,0.45)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524661135-423995f22d0b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 35px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #050508;
      color: #888;
      font-size: 14px;
    }


    /* =========================
       JavaScript / jQuery 효과용 스타일
       ========================= */

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    header {
      transition: background 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    header.scrolled {
      background: rgba(5, 5, 10, 0.98);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    }

    .menu a {
      transition: color 0.25s ease;
      position: relative;
    }

    .menu a.active {
      color: #f6c453;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .menu a.active::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      bottom: -6px;
      width: 100%;
      height: 2px;
      background: #f6c453;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .btn,
    .info-card,
    .theme-card,
    .stats-card,
    .date-box,
    .time-buttons button {
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, border 0.25s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(246,196,83,0.24);
    }

    .info-card:hover,
    .stats-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: rgba(246,196,83,0.55);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .theme-card {
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .theme-img {
      transition: transform 0.35s ease, filter 0.35s ease;
    }

    .theme-card:hover .theme-img,
    .theme-card.hovered .theme-img {
      transform: scale(1.08);
      filter: brightness(1.12);
    }

    .theme-card:hover,
    .theme-card.hovered,
    .theme-card.selected {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
      border-color: rgba(246,196,83,0.75);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.42);
    }

    .theme-card.selected {
      outline: 2px solid rgba(246,196,83,0.35);
    }

    .date-box.selected,
    .time-buttons button.selected {
      background: #f6c453;
      color: #121212;
      border-color: #f6c453;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(246,196,83,0.18);
    }

    .time-buttons button.soldout,
    .time-buttons button:disabled {
      background: #2b2b34;
      color: #777;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      opacity: 0.58;
      text-decoration: line-through;
      transform: none;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .reset-btn {
      margin-top: 12px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      background: transparent;
    }

    .reservation-result {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(246,196,83,0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(246,196,83,0.4);
      color: #f5f5f5;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .reservation-result.error {
      background: rgba(255,87,87,0.12);
      border-color: rgba(255,87,87,0.5);
      color: #ffb3b3;
    }

    .fade-target {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(22px);
      transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
    }

    .fade-target.show {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .theme-stats .fill {
      width: 0;
      transition: width 1.2s ease;
    }

    .theme-stats.show .rate68 { width: 68%; }
    .theme-stats.show .rate44 { width: 44%; }
    .theme-stats.show .rate73 { width: 73%; }
    .theme-stats.show .rate29 { width: 29%; }


    /* =========================
       추가 상호작용 효과
       ========================= */

    #loadingScreen {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 9999;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1b1724 0%, #050508 70%);
      color: #f6c453;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .loader-key {
      font-size: 46px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      animation: keySpin 1.4s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes keySpin {
      0% { transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1); }
      50% { transform: rotate(18deg) scale(1.12); }
      100% { transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1); }
    }

    #scrollProgress {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 4px;
      z-index: 9998;
      background: #f6c453;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(246,196,83,0.8);
    }

    header, main, footer {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .hero h1 .typing-cursor {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #f6c453;
      animation: blink 0.8s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes blink {
      0%, 45% { opacity: 1; }
      46%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
    }

    .theme-card.clicked-effect {
      animation: clickPop 0.35s ease;
    }

    @keyframes clickPop {
      0% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.04); }
      100% { transform: scale(1); }
    }

    .theme-detail-box {
        margin-top: 18px;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        border: 1px solid rgba(246,196,83,0.22);
        color: #ddd;
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    .theme-detail-box strong {
        color: #f6c453;
    }

    .input-focus {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(246,196,83,0.35);
      background: #262633 !important;
    }

    .shake {
      animation: shake 0.32s ease;
    }

    @keyframes shake {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
      25% { transform: translateX(-5px); }
      50% { transform: translateX(5px); }
      75% { transform: translateX(-3px); }
    }

    .char-count {
      margin-top: 6px;
      text-align: right;
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .notice-list li {
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: color 0.25s ease, padding-left 0.25s ease;
    }

    .notice-list li:hover {
      color: #f6c453;
      padding-left: 8px;
    }

    .notice-detail {
      display: none;
      margin: 8px 0 8px 0;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(246,196,83,0.1);
      color: #ddd;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    tbody tr {
      transition: background 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
    }

    tbody tr:hover {
      background: rgba(246,196,83,0.12);
      transform: scale(1.01);
    }

    .map-dummy {
      transition: transform 0.35s ease, filter 0.35s ease;
    }

    .map-dummy:hover {
      transform: scale(1.03);
      filter: brightness(1.2);
    }

    #topBtn {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      right: 24px;
      bottom: 24px;
      z-index: 9997;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: none;
      background: #f6c453;
      color: #111;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    }

    #topBtn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .modal-bg {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 9996;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.75);
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .modal-box {
      width: min(420px, 100%);
      padding: 28px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #15151f;
      border: 1px solid rgba(246,196,83,0.45);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .modal-box h3 {
      color: #f6c453;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .modal-box p {
      color: #ccc;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .confetti {
      position: fixed;
      top: -10px;
      width: 8px;
      height: 12px;
      background: #f6c453;
      z-index: 10000;
      animation: fall 1.8s linear forwards;
    }

    @keyframes fall {
      to {
        transform: translateY(105vh) rotate(720deg);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    } 

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .menu {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 42px;
      }

      .about-box,
      .theme-grid,
      .stats-box,
      .guide-grid,
      .location-box {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .reservation-layout {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .left-area,
      .right-area {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .date-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .stat-item {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .stat-item b {
        text-align: left;
      }
    }
  </style>
  <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>
</head>

<body>

  <div id="loadingScreen">
    <div class="loader-key">🔑</div>
    <div>HIDDEN KEY LOADING</div>
  </div>
  <div id="scrollProgress"></div>
  <header>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Hidden Key</a>

      <div class="menu">
        <a href="#about">소개</a>
        <a href="#theme">테마</a>
        <a href="#stats">성공률</a>
        <a href="#reservation">예약하기</a>
        <a href="#guide">이용안내</a>
        <a href="#location">위치</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <small>ESCAPE ROOM CAFE</small>
        <h1>당신은 이 방에서<br>탈출할 수 있을까?</h1>
        <p>
          Hidden Key는 몰입형 스토리와 다양한 난이도의 테마를 제공하는 방탈출 카페입니다.
          <br>
          테마별 탈출 <span class="highlight">성공률</span>을 확인하고 자신에게 맞는 테마를 선택할 수 있습니다.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="#theme" class="btn btn-primary">테마 보기</a>
          <a href="#stats" class="btn btn-outline">탈출 성공률 확인</a>
          <a href="#reservation" class="btn btn-primary">예약하기</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="section-title">
        <span>ABOUT</span>
        <h2>Hidden Key 소개</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="about-box">
        <div class="info-card">
          <h3>몰입형 스토리</h3>
          <p>각 테마마다 독립적인 세계관과 사건 흐름을 구성하여 실제 이야기 속에 들어온 듯한 경험을 제공합니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
          <h3>다양한 난이도</h3>
          <p>방세포부터 고인물까지 즐길 수 있도록 쉬움, 보통, 어려움 단계의 테마를 제공합니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
          <h3>탈출 가능성 정보</h3>
          <p>테마별 성공률과 난이도를 함께 제공하여 사용자가 자신의 수준에 맞는 테마를 선택할 수 있도록 돕습니다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="theme">
      <div class="section-title">
        <span>THEMES</span>
        <h2>테마</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="theme-grid">
        <article class="theme-card">
          <div class="theme-img" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509248961158-e54f6934749c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80')"></div>
